  "description": "The depot will be designed to hold 10 no. 10 car trains/2 x 5-car/8-car at any one time. During operation of the depot, the trains will be scanned upon entry with the AVIS unit, externally cleaned using the carriage washing machine and then internally cleaned by train presentation staff. Maintenance staff on site will consist of Train Cleaners, Shunters/Movers and Managers and will usually attend site on night shift i.e. 22:00-06:00. There will be no major maintenance works occurring at this site. The number of drivers is anticipated to be up to 20 persons on site at any one time i.e. two shifts (04:00 to 10:00) and late (15.00 to 17.00)."
